{"module":"practice","item":{"id":"b1-practice-51","level":"B1","kind":"mcq","title":{"de":"Nomen-Verb-Verbindungen","bn":"noun + verb"},"questions":[{"type":"mcq","prompt":"eine Entscheidung ___ (সিদ্ধান্ত নেওয়া)","options":["machen","stellen","treffen"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-51-q1"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"eine Frage ___ (প্রশ্ন করা)","options":["stellen","treffen","leisten"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-51-q2"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"einen Termin ___ (অ্যাপয়েন্টমেন্ট ঠিক করা)","options":["treffen","vereinbaren","leisten"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-51-q3"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„einen Antrag stellen“ মানে কী?","options":["প্রশ্ন করা","সাহায্য করা","আবেদন করা"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-51-q4"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Nach dem Unfall musste er sofort Hilfe ___.","options":["leisten","stellen","treffen"],"answer":0,"explanation":"Hilfe leisten।","id":"b1-practice-51-q5"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Darf ich Ihnen eine Frage ___?","options":["treffen","stellen","machen"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-51-q6"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich möchte einen Termin beim Arzt ___.","options":["leisten","stellen","vereinbaren"],"answer":2,"id":"b1-practice-51-q7"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Wir müssen bald eine Entscheidung ___.","options":["treffen","stellen","leisten"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-51-q8"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Sie tut so, als ob sie mich nicht ___.","options":["gekannt","kennen würde","kennt würde"],"answer":1,"explanation":"als ob + Konjunktiv II: würde + infinitive-ও চলে।","id":"b1-practice-51-q9"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"Ich spreche mit dem ___. (der Kollege)","options":["Kollege","Kolleges","Kollegen"],"answer":2,"explanation":"n-Deklination: Dativ → -n।","id":"b1-practice-51-q10"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Werbung“ মানে কী?","options":["বিজ্ঞাপন","অভ্যাস","নিবন্ধন"],"answer":0,"id":"b1-practice-51-q11"},{"type":"mcq","prompt":"„die Gewohnheit“ মানে কী?","options":["সংযোগ","অভ্যাস","আচরণ"],"answer":1,"id":"b1-practice-51-q12"},{"type":"mcq",